How about a trophy for best score PER games started?

This would effectively eliminate start-scummers from competition, and
would possibly be awarded to someone who only played one (really good)
game.  I don't think this is more impressive than Marvin's perfect
"Best of 13" score, so maybe it shouldn't be the Grand Trophy after
all.  But I would put it in with the Major Trophies, since it would be
EXTREMELY impressive for someone to capture both this one and another
Major.  It's kind of like the unique deaths one in that regard.

For that matter, shouldn't we be discouraging start-scumming
altogether?  I propose that everyone's score-per-game ratio is
displayed prominently when they are in competition for a trophy.  So we
can know who the "real deals" are. :)

Likewise, the clan score should be divided by number of members.  That
way you have to be very picky about who you invite, instead of just
going for numbers.

I'm sure I'll come up with more ideas soon.



